This will allow the workstream to move from a first-cut prioritisation to a more detailed source-aligned inventory over time.

12. Summary

The initial prioritisation should be approached pragmatically:
	•	use the AI use case descriptions to identify where unstructured data is needed
	•	classify by data type and knowledge domain first
	•	add named source detail where known
	•	refine progressively as architecture discovery continues

This approach enables the workstream to provide an immediate strategic response while building toward a more detailed and governed inventory.
